.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk

# Mac OS 6 to 9
Desktop DB
Desktop DF
TheFindByContentFolder
TheVolumeSettingsFolder
.FBCIndex
.FBCSemaphoreFile
.FBCLockFolder

